<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39768" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐπίκλοπ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thievish, tricky,
			wily</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠπεροπῆά τ᾽ ἔμεν καὶ
			ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				11.364
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κερδαλέος κ᾽ εἴη καὶ
			ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				13.291
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἦθος</span>, of women, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				67
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				149
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικλοπώτερον . . τὸ θῆλυ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					781a
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. λόγοις</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρῆσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Corn.
					<u>ND</u>
					16
				</span></i>
			. Adv., 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procop.
					<u>Arc.</u>
					25
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Goth.</u>
				4.30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. c.gen.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἔπλεο μύθων</span>
			<i>cunning</i> in speech, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				22.281
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ</span>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔπλετο τόξων</span>
			<i>cunning</i> in archery, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				21.397
			</span></i>.</div>
